OL,12,G0455 Grand Designs
OL,13,     FDesign engineer Mark, who uses a
OL,14,     Fwheelchair, plans to build a
OL,15,     Fcutting-edge, accessible family
OL,16,     Fhome for #600k. But it's a huge
OL,17,     Femotional strain for him and his
OL,18,     Fwife Penny.
